cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "axonos-consent"
message: >-
  If you use or build against this software, please cite it using the
  metadata below. The specification it implements is SPEC.md in the same
  repository.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Denis
    family-names: Yermakou
    email: connect@axonos.org
    affiliation: "The AxonOS Project"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AxonOS-org/axonos-consent"
url: "https://axonos.org"
abstract: >-
  Consent enforcement for brain–computer interfaces: the reference
  implementation of the AxonOS Consent Specification 0.6.0. An authenticated
  (Ed25519, RFC 8032), replay-protected consent state machine with a
  linearizable publication gate, in no_std Rust.
keywords:
  - brain-computer interface
  - consent
  - ed25519
  - real-time systems
  - formal verification
  - rust
license: [Apache-2.0, MIT]
version: "0.9.2"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
